    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16540" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄστικτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not marked with</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στίγματα,</span>
			<i>not tattooed,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἄστικτον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					5.6
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χωρίον ἄ.</span> an estate <i>not
				pledged</i> or <i>mortgaged</i> (those that were so being
				<i>marked by</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στῆλαι</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅροι</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				3S.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				1D.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				3.85
			</span></i>.</div>
